WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.987
When you know the file you want
but can’t remember its path,

2
00:00:03.987 --> 00:00:06.080
you can look it up from the prompt.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.209
Open slash files and
type part of the name.

4
00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:12.627
Only matching files stay in the list.

5
00:00:12.627 --> 00:00:15.501
Choose one and its path
lands in your draft.

6
00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:19.160
You can finish writing your
question before you send it.

7
00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:29.022
The same workbench has pickers
for commands and Git changes.

8
00:00:29.022 --> 00:00:31.833
You can open them without
leaving the terminal.
